    "identifier": "medical-release-venom-shock",
    "description": "<p>You begin to generate a surge of medical release chakra and imitate the violent and un controllable currents of lightning release nature transformations.</p>\n<p>Select one creature you can see within range. The target creature must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, they take 3d8 poison damage and gain the Envenomed condition or half as much on a successful save and no further effect.</p>\n<p>A creature Envenomed as a result of this jutsu suffers a -1 penalty to Strength saving throws for each rank of Envenomed they have.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, the damage by 1d8</p>",
